  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-todo-panel",
      "text": "一个基于 [dsh-better-sidebar](https://github.com/omdsh-dev/DSH-better-sidebar) 的 **TODO 任务清单**侧边栏插件：卡片式布局、优先级颜色标记、中文界面、按会话持久化。\n\n> A task-list (TODO) sidebar panel for dsh-better-sidebar: card layout, priority colors, Chinese UI, per-session persistence."
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 📋 **TODO 任务列表**：在 better-sidebar 侧边栏「+」菜单中打开「TODO」面板\n- 🎨 **优先级颜色标记**：高（红）/ 中（橙）/ 低（绿）；添加时选择，点击标签循环切换\n- 🃏 **卡片式布局**：每项任务独立卡片，左侧优先级色带，悬停上浮\n- 🌐 **中文界面**：界面文案跟随中文，输入框 / 按钮 / 计数 / 清除全部中文化\n- 💾 **按会话持久化**：任务保存到浏览器 localStorage（`dsh-todo-panel:<sessionId>`），刷新不丢失、会话互不干扰"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh"
    },
    {
      "section": "npm（发布后）",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add dsh-todo-panel"
    },
    {
      "section": "或 GitHub 源",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:zhangkkkai/dsh-todo-panel\n```\n\n前置依赖：DeepSeek Harness web（≥ 0.1.0-rc.5）+ [dsh-better-sidebar](https://github.com/omdsh-dev/DSH-better-sidebar)（≥ 0.12.0）。\n\n安装后**重启 dsh web**，在 better-sidebar 侧边栏「+」菜单打开「TODO」即可。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm install\npnpm run build     # tsc 类型 + tsdown 打包\npnpm run typecheck # 仅类型检查\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](./LICENSE)"
    }
